### Category Label Config (`barGroupConfig.categoryLabelConfig`)

Controls how category labels are truncated, wrapped, and how overflow is handled.

| Prop                     | Type                                | Default       | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
| ------------------------ | ----------------------------------- | ------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `maxWords`               | `number`                            | `3`           | Maximum words per label before truncation with "…"                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
| `maxLines`               | `number`                            | `1`           | Maximum display lines per label (enables word-wrap)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
| `othersLabel`            | `string`                            | `"Others"`    | Label text for the overflow group bar                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
| `overflowType`           | `"grouped" \| "truncated" \| "all"` | `"truncated"` | `"truncated"` (default): bars that don't fit are removed from the right. `"grouped"`: overflow items aggregated into an "Others" stacked bar. `"all"`: every bar is rendered but in-between category labels are skipped to prevent overlap (hovering any bar — including those with hidden labels — reveals the full category name in the hover badge and the `onBarHover` callback) |
| `skippedLabels`          | `"auto" \| number`                  | `"auto"`      | Only used when `overflowType` is `"all"`. `"auto"` dynamically calculates which labels to show based on available width (first and last always included). A `number` sets an explicit skip interval (e.g., `1` = every other label, `2` = every 3rd)                                                                                                                                |
| `enableOverflowGrouping` | `boolean`                           | `false`       | **Deprecated** — use `overflowType` instead. `true` maps to `"grouped"`, `false` maps to `"truncated"`                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
| `labelWidth`             | `"fluid" \| number`                 | `"fluid"`     | Label sizing mode: `"fluid"` dynamically fills available space with design-token gaps (`Dimensions/Spacings/4`); a `number` sets a fixed pixel width per label                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
| `othersPosition`         | `"sorted" \| "end"`                 | `"end"`       | `"end"`: always pinned to the far right; `"sorted"`: Others bar positioned by its accumulated value (maintains descending order)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
| `othersHeight`           | `"relative" \| "full" \| number`    | `"relative"`  | `"relative"`: height proportional to accumulated value via D3 scale; `"full"`: stretches to full bar area height and regular bars rescale to fill full height; `number`: fixed pixel height and regular bars rescale to fill full height                                                                                                                                            |

### ChartFooter Config (`chartFooterConfig`)

| Prop                   | Type      | Default     | Description                  |
| ---------------------- | --------- | ----------- | ---------------------------- |
| `annotationLeft`       | `boolean` | `true`      | Show the left annotation slot |
| `annotationLeftValue`  | `string`  | `"Source: Jio."` | Source attribution in footer |
| `annotationRight`      | `boolean` | `true`      | Show the right annotation slot |
| `annotationRightValue` | `string`  | `"Additional notes."` | Notes text in footer         |

### Accessibility Config (`accessibility`)

| Prop        | Type      | Default  | Description                                              |
| ----------- | --------- | -------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |
| `enabled`   | `boolean` | `true`   | Enable accessibility wrapper (ARIA, data table, summary) |
| `summary`   | `string`  | `"auto"` | Custom summary or `"auto"` for auto-generated            |
| `dataTable` | `boolean` | `true`   | Hidden data table for screen reader navigation           |
| `ariaLabel` | `string`  | auto-generated | Custom `aria-label` override for the chart          |

